Resolve Mermaid entity placeholders in HTTP/HTTPS URL authorities before host/IDNA normalization in formatUrl, and decode percent-encoded placeholders (%EF%AC%82%C2%B0...%C2%B6%C3%9F) strictly inside href/xlink:href attributes in cleanUpSvgCode without touching unrelated text labels or %XX escapes.

diff --git a/packages/mermaid/src/mermaidAPI.ts b/packages/mermaid/src/mermaidAPI.ts
